---
Title: callout types
---

Every built-in type and alias, then the GFM spellings, which are matched
case-insensitively.

> [!note]
> The `note` callout.

> [!abstract]
> The `abstract` callout.

> [!summary]
> The `summary` callout.

> [!tldr]
> The `tldr` callout.

> [!info]
> The `info` callout.

> [!todo]
> The `todo` callout.

> [!tip]
> The `tip` callout.

> [!hint]
> The `hint` callout.

> [!important]
> The `important` callout.

> [!success]
> The `success` callout.

> [!check]
> The `check` callout.

> [!done]
> The `done` callout.

> [!question]
> The `question` callout.

> [!help]
> The `help` callout.

> [!faq]
> The `faq` callout.

> [!warning]
> The `warning` callout.

> [!caution]
> The `caution` callout.

> [!attention]
> The `attention` callout.

> [!failure]
> The `failure` callout.

> [!fail]
> The `fail` callout.

> [!missing]
> The `missing` callout.

> [!danger]
> The `danger` callout.

> [!error]
> The `error` callout.

> [!bug]
> The `bug` callout.

> [!example]
> The `example` callout.

> [!quote]
> The `quote` callout.

> [!cite]
> The `cite` callout.

> [!compatibility]
> The `compatibility` callout.

> [!suggestion]
> The `suggestion` callout, jmarkdown's own.

> [!NOTE]
> GFM spelling: NOTE.

> [!TIP]
> GFM spelling: TIP.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> GFM spelling: IMPORTANT.

> [!WARNING]
> GFM spelling: WARNING.

> [!CAUTION]
> GFM spelling: CAUTION.
